---
import SectionHeader from "../common/SectionHeader.astro";
---

<section id="product" class="scroll-mt-20 bg-white py-14 sm:py-14 sm:py-16 lg:py-20">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-[1280px] grid-cols-1 gap-10 px-6 lg:grid-cols-[0.55fr_1.45fr] lg:gap-20 lg:px-10">
    <div>
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[var(--color-accent-orange)]">
        The Concept
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <SectionHeader
        title="A removable compartment becomes the unit of each scheduled dispense event."
        description="Medication occurrences due at the same exact time are grouped into one device dispense event. Their combined medication-and-quantity set defines what the caregiver prepares in one removable compartment."
      />

      <p class="mt-5 max-w-[800px] sm:mt-6 text-lg leading-8 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">
        Up to eleven operational compartments can be installed across twelve rotating carrier positions. When an event becomes due, the assigned compartment moves to Base Slot A for verification. Only after the expected contents pass inspection does the same physical compartment move to Base Slot L for dispensing.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
